      "ref": "1.8",
      "name": "What the Ear Cannot Hear",
      "devanagari": "यच्छ्रोत्रेण न शृणोति येन श्रोत्रमिदं श्रुतम् ।\nतदेव ब्रह्म त्वं विद्धि नेदं यदिदमुपासते ॥",
      "transliteration": "yacchrotreṇa na śṛṇoti yena śrotramidaṁ śrutam\ntadeva brahma tvaṁ viddhi nedaṁ yadidamupāsate",
      "translation": "What the ear cannot hear — but by which this ear hears — know that alone to be Brahman, not this that people worship here.",
