      "ref": "1.9",
      "name": "What Breath Cannot Breathe",
      "devanagari": "यत्प्राणेन न प्राणिति येन प्राणः प्रणीयते ।\nतदेव ब्रह्म त्वं विद्धि नेदं यदिदमुपासते ॥",
      "transliteration": "yatprāṇena na prāṇiti yena prāṇaḥ praṇīyate\ntadeva brahma tvaṁ viddhi nedaṁ yadidamupāsate",
      "translation": "What breath cannot breathe — but by which breath is drawn onward — know that alone to be Brahman, not this that people worship here.",
